# §11.4.30 / CONST-053 repository hygiene, scoped to container/.
#
# The Python modules here (the speech-to-text server, its catalogue wiring and
# the shared model gate) are source and ARE tracked. Their byte-compiled caches
# are build derivatives — regenerated by the interpreter on import — and are
# never versioned.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
